{"guid":"grp-74-0","timestamp_unix_ms":1759784523749,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Long and her nieces.","attachments":[],"imessage":{"is_reply":false,"in_reply_to_guid":null,"thread_originator_part":null,"num_replies":null,"is_deleted":false,"send_effect":null,"shared_location":null,"announcement":null,"read_receipt_rfc3339":null,"parts":null,"edits":null,"tapbacks":[{"emoji":null,"is_from_me":false,"kind":"disliked","part_index":0,"sender":"+16192919851"}],"app":null,"balloon_bundle_id":null,"balloon_kind":null,"associated_guid":null,"associated_part":null,"tapback_kind":null,"tapback_emoji":null,"tapback_action":null},"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-1","timestamp_unix_ms":1761733252954,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+16192919851","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" \"And of your infliction,\" cried Elizabeth, with energy; \"You have reduced him to his present state of poverty--comparative poverty.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-2","timestamp_unix_ms":1763296911511,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+17868488225","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" \"He came down to see the place\" This was invitation enough.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-3","timestamp_unix_ms":1764742845275,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+15165022407","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Could he expect to be noticed again by the regiment, after such an affront to Colonel Forster? Very little was said by either; Kitty was too much afraid of him to talk; Elizabeth was secretly forming a desperate resolution; and, perhaps, he might be doing the same.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-4","timestamp_unix_ms":1766116259378,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+17864115982","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I am very sensible of the honour of your proposals, but it is impossible for me to do otherwise than decline them.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-5","timestamp_unix_ms":1767438948092,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+16192919851","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" Elizabeth looked with unaffected astonishment.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-6","timestamp_unix_ms":1768723168344,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+17868488225","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Bingley to see you all after him so soon; for, if I recollect right, he went but the day before.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-7","timestamp_unix_ms":1769974300407,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Elizabeth blushed and blushed again with shame and vexation.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-8","timestamp_unix_ms":1771199010834,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+17864115982","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"The business was therefore soon settled. Surprise was the least of all her feelings on this development.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-9","timestamp_unix_ms":1772399729022,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+16192919851","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Lydia was exceedingly fond of him.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-10","timestamp_unix_ms":1773580998972,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+17868488225","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Human nature is so prone to fall into it!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-11","timestamp_unix_ms":1774743162807,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+15165022407","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"it was melancholy to leave her to such society!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-12","timestamp_unix_ms":1775893082038,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+17864115982","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"What a pity it is, mamma, we did not all go! Well, Monday morning came, and I was in such a fuss!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-13","timestamp_unix_ms":1777027871145,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+16192919851","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"This matter may be considered, therefore, as finally settled.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-14","timestamp_unix_ms":1778148607949,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" \"A man in distressed circumstances has not time for all those elegant decorums which other people may observe.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-15","timestamp_unix_ms":1779257115470,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+15165022407","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" Elizabeth assured him that she could suit herself perfectly with those in the room. She followed him with her eyes, envied everyone to whom he spoke, had scarcely patience enough to help anybody to coffee, and then was enraged against herself for being so silly!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-16","timestamp_unix_ms":1780355084337,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+17864115982","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I was so afraid, you know, that something would happen to put it off, and then I should have gone quite distracted.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-17","timestamp_unix_ms":1781444779735,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+16192919851","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"But he found Lydia absolutely resolved on remaining where she was. Hurst or Miss Bingley; and even Lydia was too much fatigued to utter more than the occasional exclamation of \"Lord, how tired I am!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-18","timestamp_unix_ms":1782521456050,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+17868488225","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"You have delighted us long enough.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-19","timestamp_unix_ms":1783591730297,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+15165022407","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Your superior knowledge of your sister must make the latter probable.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-20","timestamp_unix_ms":1784652285751,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+17864115982","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"No one admitted to the privilege of hearing you can think anything wanting.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-74-21","timestamp_unix_ms":1785706239749,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"You were disgusted with the women who were always speaking, and looking, and thinking for _your_ approbation alone.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
